message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AAAPS: AI-Augmented Academic Performance Simulation (v0.3)"
abstract: >-
  A networked agent-based model of 240 undergraduate students across six academic
  sections, simulating how differential access to generative AI tools interacts with
  individual ability, socioeconomic status, and peer social networks to shape academic
  inequality and cognitive dependency.
